WEBVTT

00:10:29.958 --> 00:10:31.293
and all over the world,

00:10:31.293 --> 00:10:35.130
will be exposed to computer
vision applied broadly.

00:10:35.631 --> 00:10:36.632
And with that,

00:10:36.632 --> 00:10:38.842
all industries will be transformed,

00:10:38.842 --> 00:10:41.762
and we will experience the world
in a different way.

00:10:42.262 --> 00:10:45.557
I hope you can join me
in agreeing that this is a gift

00:10:45.557 --> 00:10:50.270
that we almost owe
our next generation that is coming,

00:10:50.270 --> 00:10:53.816
because there are a lot of things
that computer vision will help us solve.

00:10:54.191 --> 00:10:55.192
Thank you.

00:10:55.192 --> 00:10:57.986
(Applause)